  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Todo est&aacute; ya preparado para que Onda viva este viernes, de 20 a 24 horas, su primera Fashion Night, que conicide con la segunda jornada de la V Ruta de la Tapa de Hosturionda.</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">Participan 22 tiendas, dos pubs y dos cafeter&iacute;as, con actividades, descuentos especiales y consumiciones gratuitas por las compras en los establecimientos.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220599.jpg\" alt=\"p1220599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220603.jpg\" alt=\"p1220603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220605.jpg\" alt=\"p1220605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220607.jpg\" alt=\"p1220607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220611.jpg\" alt=\"p1220611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220685.jpg\" alt=\"p1220685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220687.jpg\" alt=\"p1220687\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220688.jpg\" alt=\"p1220688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparatiusfashionnight/p1220689.jpg\" alt=\"p1220689\" style=\